Changed from the original: the mastery policy, retention scheduler, grading rules and
memory rules were ported from Python packages to a standalone CLI (scripts/). The personas
(output-styles/) are copied with new frontmatter. Prompts for the mastery loop, question
generation, deep solve, research, visualization, reading, books, co-writing, notebook and
memory were rewritten as Claude Code skills and agents (skills/, agents/). DeepTutor's
server, web app, provider layer, embedding-based knowledge bases, partners and media
generation are not included.
